       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    FBNMENU.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  FIBERNET - TELECOMMUNICATION / FIBERNET BROADBAND SYSTEM       
      *  MODULE   : MAIN MENU DRIVER                                    
      *  FUNCTION : Displays the main menu and CALLs the sub-modules.   
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT MENUFILE ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-FBNMENUD-SI
               ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
               FILE STATUS IS WS-DSP-STS.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  MENUFILE LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF FBNMENUD.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-DSP-STS          PIC X(02) VALUE SPACES.
       01  WS-INDIC.
           05  EXIT-KEY        PIC 1 INDICATOR 03 VALUE B"0".
       01  WS-PGM              PIC X(10) VALUE SPACES.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       000-MAIN.
           OPEN I-O MENUFILE.
           PERFORM 100-PROCESS-MENU
               UNTIL EXIT-KEY = B"1" OR OPTION = 90.
           CLOSE MENUFILE.
           STOP RUN.

       100-PROCESS-MENU.
           MOVE SPACES TO MSGTXT.
           MOVE ZEROS  TO OPTION.
           WRITE MENUFMT.
           READ MENUFILE.
           IF EXIT-KEY = B"1"
               GO TO 100-EXIT.
           EVALUATE OPTION
               WHEN 1  MOVE "CUSTMNT" TO WS-PGM
               WHEN 2  MOVE "PLANMNT" TO WS-PGM
               WHEN 3  MOVE "BILLGEN" TO WS-PGM
               WHEN 4  MOVE "PAYPROC" TO WS-PGM
               WHEN 5  MOVE "CMPMNT"  TO WS-PGM
               WHEN 6  MOVE "BILLRPT" TO WS-PGM
               WHEN 90 MOVE SPACES    TO WS-PGM
               WHEN OTHER
                   MOVE SPACES TO WS-PGM
                   MOVE "Invalid option - try again." TO MSGTXT
           END-EVALUATE.
           IF WS-PGM NOT = SPACES
               CALL WS-PGM
           END-IF.
       100-EXIT.
           EXIT.
